          "summary": "Google DeepMind published its AI Control Roadmap, a defense-in-depth framework for securing internal AI agents that treats untrusted agents as potential insider threats using the MITRE ATT&CK taxonomy. The system uses trusted AI supervisors to monitor agent chain-of-thought reasoning, and the team has analyzed over one million coding agent trajectories to refine detection. A companion policy framework, 'Three Layers of Agent Security,' was also released.",
